EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Yesterday was {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Teacher's Day{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Goodness, did it pass by in a flash!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}I hope it's just as fun next year!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hier, c'était la {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}fête des profs{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} C'est
passé à une de ces vitesses !{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Vivement l'année prochaine, hi hi !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ieri era la Festa dei maestri.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Purtroppo è già finita...{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0005:}}È stato
un evento veramente fuffissimo!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Dün {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Öğretmenler Günü{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}ydü.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Aman, nasıl da çabucak geçti!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Umarım seneye de bu kadar
eğlenceli olur!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}From now until next {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Teacher's Day{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}},{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
I want to make sure to show some
respect to my elders.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}D'ici à la prochaine {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}fête des profs{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}},{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
je veillerai à respecter tous ceux qui
ont contribué à mon éducation.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bir sonraki {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Öğretmenler Günü{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}ne{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
kadar büyüklerime saygımı
göstermeyi ihmal etmeyeceğim.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Spero che resterai con noi, oggi!
L'atmosfera qui {{TAG:000E:0010:}} {{TAG:0005:0005:}}
per la Festa dei maestri è speciale!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Since you've come all this way,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
I hope you enjoy our happy little
version of {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Teacher's Day{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ya que has venido hasta aquí,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¡quédate a disfrutar del
Día del Maestro!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Après avoir fait tout ce chemin,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
vous avez bien mérité de profiter de
notre {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}fête des profs{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Visto che hai fatto tanta strada,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
perché non ti fermi {{TAG:000E:0010:}} {{TAG:0005:0005:}}
per la {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Festa dei maestri{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bunca yolu geldiğine göre{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
bizim neşeli {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Öğretmenler Günü{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
kutlamamızın tadını çıkar!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I've prepared something special
to celebrate {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Teacher's Day{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Would you like to see?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tengo un regalo especial para ti
por ser el Día del Maestro.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}¿Quieres verlo?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ho preparato una cosina che spero
ti aiuterà ad entrare nel clima
della Festa dei maestri.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Tieni!{{TAG:0003:0026:}}

EN:
It's a {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}red-carnation bag{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Please have a fun time
for today's {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Teacher's Day{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!

ES:
¡Un {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}clavel rojo{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Diviértete en el
Día del Maestro!

IT:
È un {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}garofano rosso{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Portalo con te mentre celebri
con noi la Festa dei maestri!

TRANSLATION:
Bu bir {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}kırmızı karanfil çantası{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bugünkü {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Öğretmenler Günü{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}nde
